      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The authorisation may:\n\n(a) specify the uses to which the material can be put by the ICC;\nand\n\n(b) include a direction to a law enforcement officer of the law\nenforcement agency about how the material is to be provided\nto the ICC.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The authorisation may:\n\n(a) specify the uses to which the material can be put by the ICC;\nand\n\n(b) include a direction to a law enforcement officer of the law\nenforcement agency about how the material is to be provided\nto the ICC.",
