      "cml:integrityHash": "57c69f41b35c781c68898fa656b6643396c07b3e47df06cf5a444f930b3758a2",
      "skos:note": "Authorisation for material provision to ICC"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-69a-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "69A(2) Authorising provision of material obtained by law enforcement",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The authorisation may:\n\n(a) specify the uses to which the material can be put by the ICC;\nand\n\n(b) include a direction to a law enforcement officer of the law\nenforcement agency about how the material is to be provided\nto the ICC."
    },
