      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Material lawfully obtained in Australia includes:\n\n(a) material obtained from individuals or entities by consent; and\n\n(b) material obtained by warrant, or the exercise of a coercive\npower by a court, in Australia for the purposes of a domestic\ninvestigation or prosecution.\nInternational War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Material lawfully obtained in Australia includes:\n\n(a) material obtained from individuals or entities by consent; and\n\n(b) material obtained by warrant, or the exercise of a coercive\npower by a court, in Australia for the purposes of a domestic\ninvestigation or prosecution.\nInternational War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995",
      "values:partOf": {
