    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-107p",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "107P Condition for giving a foreign preservation notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-107p"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An entity mentioned in the following table may request the\nAustralian Federal Police to arrange for the preservation of stored\ncommunications that:\n\n(a) relate to a specified person or specified telecommunications\nservice; and\n\n(b) are held by a carrier; and\n\n(c) are relevant to an investigation, investigative proceeding, or\nproceeding relating to a serious foreign contravention;\nif the entity intends to make a request (an access request) under a\nprovision mentioned in the table to the Attorney-General to arrange\nfor access to those stored communications.\n\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An entity mentioned in the following table may request the\nAustralian Federal Police to arrange for the preservation of stored\ncommunications that:\n\n(a) relate to a specified person or specified telecommunications\nservice; and\n\n(b) are held by a carrier; and\n\n(c) are relevant to an investigation, investigative proceeding, or\nproceeding relating to a serious foreign contravention;\nif the entity intends to make a request (an access request) under a\nprovision mentioned in the table to the Attorney-General to arrange\nfor access to those stored communications.\n\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-107p-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-107p-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c563b4ed0e557302ce293e68c7a5dd4851b10679a94f33d8379393a82d381360",
      "skos:note": "Entity can request preservation of stored communications for investigation purposes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-107p",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "107P Condition for giving a foreign preservation notice",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 21,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An entity mentioned in the following table may request the\nAustralian Federal Police to arrange for the preservation of stored\ncommunications that:\n\n(a) relate to a specified person or specified telecommunications\nservice; and\n\n(b) are held by a carrier; and\n\n(c) are relevant to an investigation, investigative proceeding, or\nproceeding relating to a serious foreign contravention;\nif the entity intends to make a request (an access request) under a\nprovision mentioned in the table to the Attorney-General to arrange\nfor access to those stored communications.\n\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-107p-norm",
