      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\nAssistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1\nCovert access to stored communications  Part 3\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\n\n(a) an entity requests under section 107P the Australian Federal\nPolice to arrange for the preservation of stored\ncommunications that are held by a carrier; and",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\nAssistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1\nCovert access to stored communications  Part 3\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\n\n(a) an entity requests under section 107P the Australian Federal\nPolice to arrange for the preservation of stored\ncommunications that are held by a carrier; and",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-38-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3855aa87ea01a16639e873259ac795ac9e6ee7dd01fbcaf4250a6729f1ac6574",
      "skos:note": "Request for preservation of stored communications"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-38",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "38 Paragraph 107R(1)(a)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\nAssistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1\nCovert access to stored communications  Part 3\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\n\n(a) an entity requests under section 107P the Australian Federal\nPolice to arrange for the preservation of stored\ncommunications that are held by a carrier; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-38-norm",
