    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-142a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "142A Communicating information obtained as a result of an",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-142a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "international assistance application\n\n(1) If information is obtained through the execution of a warrant issued\nas a result of an international assistance application, a person may\nonly communicate the information to the entity to which the\napplication relates on the following conditions:\n\n(a) that the information will only be used for the purposes for\nwhich the entity requested the information;\n\n(b) that any document or other thing containing the information\nwill be destroyed when it is no longer required for those\npurposes;\n\n(c) any other condition determined, in writing, by the\nAttorney-General.\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals",
      "skos:definition": "international assistance application\n\n(1) If information is obtained through the execution of a warrant issued\nas a result of an international assistance application, a person may\nonly communicate the information to the entity to which the\napplication relates on the following conditions:\n\n(a) that the information will only be used for the purposes for\nwhich the entity requested the information;\n\n(b) that any document or other thing containing the information\nwill be destroyed when it is no longer required for those\npurposes;\n\n(c) any other condition determined, in writing, by the\nAttorney-General.\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-142a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-142a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "edec252d7232478e40f406f320bce37d42224a0a1063cd1652957e483ed4a905",
      "skos:note": "Conditions for communication of information obtained through international assistance application"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-142a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "142A Communicating information obtained as a result of an",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "international assistance application\n\n(1) If information is obtained through the execution of a warrant issued\nas a result of an international assistance application, a person may\nonly communicate the information to the entity to which the\napplication relates on the following conditions:\n\n(a) that the information will only be used for the purposes for\nwhich the entity requested the information;\n\n(b) that any document or other thing containing the information\nwill be destroyed when it is no longer required for those\npurposes;\n\n(c) any other condition determined, in writing, by the\nAttorney-General.\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-142a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
