      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(d) for each international offence for the agency—the offence (if\nany), under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a\nTerritory, that is of the same, or a substantially similar, nature\nto the international offence.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(d) for each international offence for the agency—the offence (if\nany), under a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a\nTerritory, that is of the same, or a substantially similar, nature\nto the international offence.",
      "cml:asserts": [
