      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subparagraph, substitute:\n\n(iiia) if the warrant was issued in relation to an international\nassistance authorisation—each offence to which the\nauthorisation relates; and",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subparagraph, substitute:\n\n(iiia) if the warrant was issued in relation to an international\nassistance authorisation—each offence to which the\nauthorisation relates; and",
