      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nRequests by a foreign country, international tribunal or foreign\nlaw enforcement agency\n\n(9) The provisions of this Part apply in relation to a forensic procedure\ncarried out because of a request by a foreign country, international\ntribunal or foreign law enforcement agency, as if a reference to an\nindictable offence were a reference to a foreign serious offence.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nRequests by a foreign country, international tribunal or foreign\nlaw enforcement agency\n\n(9) The provisions of this Part apply in relation to a forensic procedure\ncarried out because of a request by a foreign country, international\ntribunal or foreign law enforcement agency, as if a reference to an\nindictable offence were a reference to a foreign serious offence.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-110-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-110-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "75c16c9bee6d42bc49d120e40822d9047f9ff80456d74d4bb6fa136d794ab779",
      "skos:note": "Repeal subsection, substitute requests by foreign country or law enforcement agency"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-110",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "110 Subsection 23WA(9)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 46,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\nRequests by a foreign country, international tribunal or foreign\nlaw enforcement agency\n\n(9) The provisions of this Part apply in relation to a forensic procedure\ncarried out because of a request by a foreign country, international\ntribunal or foreign law enforcement agency, as if a reference to an\nindictable offence were a reference to a foreign serious offence."
    },
