      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "After “a foreign law enforcement agency”, insert “(other than an agency\nresponsible to an international tribunal)”.",
      "skos:definition": "After “a foreign law enforcement agency”, insert “(other than an agency\nresponsible to an international tribunal)”.",
      "cml:asserts": [
