      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(d) in the case of a forensic procedure requested by a foreign\ncountry or an international tribunal—a constable has been\nauthorised by the Attorney-General, under the authorising\nprovision relating to the request, to apply for an order under\nthis Part.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(d) in the case of a forensic procedure requested by a foreign\ncountry or an international tribunal—a constable has been\nauthorised by the Attorney-General, under the authorising\nprovision relating to the request, to apply for an order under\nthis Part.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-120-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-120-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "431e398da3dc7ac00585ad380df7de5defab12a0170ff271d34aa7b3f0ebe7f3",
      "skos:note": "Authorisation required for foreign country or international tribunal requests"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-120",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "120 Paragraph 23XWU(1)(d)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(d) in the case of a forensic procedure requested by a foreign\ncountry or an international tribunal—a constable has been\nauthorised by the Attorney-General, under the authorising\nprovision relating to the request, to apply for an order under\nthis Part."
    },
