      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "185 Subsection 101(3)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "Omit “under Subdivision B in respect of the property in relation to the\ncrime within the jurisdiction of the ICC, the head of the enforcement\nagency whose authorised officer seized the property”, substitute “as\ndescribed in Subdivision B in respect of the property in relation to the\ncrime within the jurisdiction of the ICC, the responsible enforcement\nagency head”."
    },
