      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.66",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “head of the enforcement agency whose authorised officer seized\nthe property, a restraining order has been made under Subdivision B”,\nsubstitute “responsible enforcement agency head, a restraining order has\nbeen made as described in Subdivision B”.\n\nAssistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1\nProceeds of crime  Part 8\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “head of the enforcement agency whose authorised officer seized\nthe property, a restraining order has been made under Subdivision B”,\nsubstitute “responsible enforcement agency head, a restraining order has\nbeen made as described in Subdivision B”.\n\nAssistance to international courts and tribunals  Schedule 1\nProceeds of crime  Part 8\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-186-norm"
        }
