    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-199",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "199 Application and transitional provisions—general",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-199"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.69",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Division, to the extent that they do not\nrelate to search warrants, apply in relation to a proceeds request made\nby the ICC to the Attorney-General:\n\n(a) on or after the commencement of this item; or\n\n(b) before the commencement of this item, if, immediately\nbefore that commencement, the Attorney-General had yet to\nmake a decision on the request.\n(2)\nThe amendments so apply:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the proceeds request\nrelates was acquired before, on or after that commencement;\nand\n\n(b) whether conduct or a crime to which the proceeds request\nrelates occurred before, on or after that commencement.\n(3)\nHowever, subsection 93(2) of the International Criminal Court Act\n2002, as inserted by this Division, applies in relation to a notice given\non or after the commencement of this item.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Division, to the extent that they do not\nrelate to search warrants, apply in relation to a proceeds request made\nby the ICC to the Attorney-General:\n\n(a) on or after the commencement of this item; or\n\n(b) before the commencement of this item, if, immediately\nbefore that commencement, the Attorney-General had yet to\nmake a decision on the request.\n(2)\nThe amendments so apply:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the proceeds request\nrelates was acquired before, on or after that commencement;\nand\n\n(b) whether conduct or a crime to which the proceeds request\nrelates occurred before, on or after that commencement.\n(3)\nHowever, subsection 93(2) of the International Criminal Court Act\n2002, as inserted by this Division, applies in relation to a notice given\non or after the commencement of this item.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-199-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c155f842537075f95f7a549c059d95efc86d2d1b2e3d0be5212dfb95c0b36b16",
      "skos:note": "Application and transitional provisions—general"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-199",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "199 Application and transitional provisions—general",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 69,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Division, to the extent that they do not\nrelate to search warrants, apply in relation to a proceeds request made\nby the ICC to the Attorney-General:\n\n(a) on or after the commencement of this item; or\n\n(b) before the commencement of this item, if, immediately\nbefore that commencement, the Attorney-General had yet to\nmake a decision on the request.\n(2)\nThe amendments so apply:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the proceeds request\nrelates was acquired before, on or after that commencement;\nand\n\n(b) whether conduct or a crime to which the proceeds request\nrelates occurred before, on or after that commencement.\n(3)\nHowever, subsection 93(2) of the International Criminal Court Act\n2002, as inserted by this Division, applies in relation to a notice given\non or after the commencement of this item."
    },
