    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40aj",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40AJ Protection from suits etc. for those complying with notices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-40aj"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.78",
      "values:originalText": "(1) No action, suit or proceeding lies against:\n\n(a) a financial institution; or\n\n(b) an officer, employee or agent of the institution acting in the\ncourse of that person’s employment or agency;\nin relation to any action taken by the institution or person under a\nnotice under section 40AH or in the mistaken belief that action was\nrequired under the notice.\n\n(2) A financial institution which, or an officer, employee or agent of a\nfinancial institution who, provides information under a notice\nunder section 40AH is taken, for the purposes of Part 10.2 of the\nCriminal Code (offences relating to money laundering), not to have\nbeen in possession of that information at any time.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) No action, suit or proceeding lies against:\n\n(a) a financial institution; or\n\n(b) an officer, employee or agent of the institution acting in the\ncourse of that person’s employment or agency;\nin relation to any action taken by the institution or person under a\nnotice under section 40AH or in the mistaken belief that action was\nrequired under the notice.\n\n(2) A financial institution which, or an officer, employee or agent of a\nfinancial institution who, provides information under a notice\nunder section 40AH is taken, for the purposes of Part 10.2 of the\nCriminal Code (offences relating to money laundering), not to have\nbeen in possession of that information at any time.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40aj-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40aj-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8bb51a30fe49273fd6f0394f15a13501865e00b2dc77d3adb94c8f9a192c9576"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-40aj",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40AJ Protection from suits etc. for those complying with notices",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 78,
      "values:originalText": "(1) No action, suit or proceeding lies against:\n\n(a) a financial institution; or\n\n(b) an officer, employee or agent of the institution acting in the\ncourse of that person’s employment or agency;\nin relation to any action taken by the institution or person under a\nnotice under section 40AH or in the mistaken belief that action was\nrequired under the notice.\n\n(2) A financial institution which, or an officer, employee or agent of a\nfinancial institution who, provides information under a notice\nunder section 40AH is taken, for the purposes of Part 10.2 of the\nCriminal Code (offences relating to money laundering), not to have\nbeen in possession of that information at any time."
    },
