      "values:originalText": "(2) A financial institution which, or an officer, employee or agent of a\nfinancial institution who, provides information under a notice\nunder section 40AH is taken, for the purposes of Part 10.2 of the\nCriminal Code (offences relating to money laundering), not to have\nbeen in possession of that information at any time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40aj-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40aj-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
