      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A person commits an offence if...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the period of two years from the date of receipt of the notice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40am-ss-1-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Permission",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Grants permission to fail to comply with the notice.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A person commits an offence if...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the person fails to comply with the notice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40am-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40AM(2) Failing to comply with a notice",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-40am-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.79",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the person fails to comply with the notice only because the\nperson does not provide information or a document within\nthe period specified in the notice; and\n\n(b) the person took all reasonable steps to provide the\ninformation or document within that period; and\n\n(c) the person provides the information or document as soon as\npracticable after the end of that period.\nNote 1:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matters in\nsubsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the person fails to comply with the notice only because the\nperson does not provide information or a document within\nthe period specified in the notice; and\n\n(b) the person took all reasonable steps to provide the\ninformation or document within that period; and\n\n(c) the person provides the information or document as soon as\npracticable after the end of that period.\nNote 1:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matters in\nsubsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40am"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40am-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d1e2b98bd2883255b50700b1cc70665863e93b1cdd07c7c14d1cd0899c5019c5",
      "skos:note": "Exemption from liability for failing to provide information within a specified period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-40am-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40AM(2) Failing to comply with a notice",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 79,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:\n\n(a) the person fails to comply with the notice only because the\nperson does not provide information or a document within\nthe period specified in the notice; and\n\n(b) the person took all reasonable steps to provide the\ninformation or document within that period; and\n\n(c) the person provides the information or document as soon as\npracticable after the end of that period.\nNote 1:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matters in\nsubsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40am-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
