    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40as-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40AS(3) Return of seized property to third parties",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-40as-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.83",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The court must order the responsible enforcement agency head to\nreturn the property to the applicant if the court is satisfied that:\n\n(a) the applicant is entitled to possession of the property; and\n\n(b) the property is not proceeds of the relevant Tribunal offence;\nand\n\n(c) the person who is believed or alleged to have committed the\nrelevant Tribunal offence has no interest in the property.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The court must order the responsible enforcement agency head to\nreturn the property to the applicant if the court is satisfied that:\n\n(a) the applicant is entitled to possession of the property; and\n\n(b) the property is not proceeds of the relevant Tribunal offence;\nand\n\n(c) the person who is believed or alleged to have committed the\nrelevant Tribunal offence has no interest in the property.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-40as"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
