    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-212",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "212 Application of amendments",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-212"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.87",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Division apply in relation to a proceeds\nrequest made by a Tribunal to the Attorney-General:\n\n(a) on or after the commencement of this item; or\n\n(b) before the commencement of this item, if, immediately\nbefore that commencement, the Attorney-General had yet to\nmake a decision on the request.\n(2)\nThe amendments so apply:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the proceeds request\nrelates was acquired before, on or after that commencement;\nand\n\n(b) whether conduct or an offence to which the proceeds request\nrelates occurred before, on or after that commencement.\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Division apply in relation to a proceeds\nrequest made by a Tribunal to the Attorney-General:\n\n(a) on or after the commencement of this item; or\n\n(b) before the commencement of this item, if, immediately\nbefore that commencement, the Attorney-General had yet to\nmake a decision on the request.\n(2)\nThe amendments so apply:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the proceeds request\nrelates was acquired before, on or after that commencement;\nand\n\n(b) whether conduct or an offence to which the proceeds request\nrelates occurred before, on or after that commencement.\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-212-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f4dc2eeb9b262f0011a07be716fe6c9caf41122c01f301aa849b5574bef8c12e",
      "skos:note": "Amendments apply in relation to proceeds requests made by Tribunals to the Attorney-General."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-1-sec-212",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "212 Application of amendments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 87,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by this Division apply in relation to a proceeds\nrequest made by a Tribunal to the Attorney-General:\n\n(a) on or after the commencement of this item; or\n\n(b) before the commencement of this item, if, immediately\nbefore that commencement, the Attorney-General had yet to\nmake a decision on the request.\n(2)\nThe amendments so apply:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the proceeds request\nrelates was acquired before, on or after that commencement;\nand\n\n(b) whether conduct or an offence to which the proceeds request\nrelates occurred before, on or after that commencement.\n\nSchedule 1  Assistance to international courts and tribunals"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-212-norm",
