      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(cb) assisting the investigation and prosecution of:\n\n(i) crimes within the jurisdiction of the ICC (within the\nmeaning of the International Criminal Court Act 2002);\nand\n\n(ii) Tribunal offences (within the meaning of the\nInternational War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995);",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(cb) assisting the investigation and prosecution of:\n\n(i) crimes within the jurisdiction of the ICC (within the\nmeaning of the International Criminal Court Act 2002);\nand\n\n(ii) Tribunal offences (within the meaning of the\nInternational War Crimes Tribunals Act 1995);",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-213-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-1-sec-213-logic-deontic-1"
