      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the section, substitute:\n\nAmendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2\nSearch warrants  Part 1\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the section, substitute:\n\nAmendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2\nSearch warrants  Part 1\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "cml:asserts": [
