      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.94",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting the directions that may be given under\nsubsection (2), the Attorney-General may direct the seizing officer\nto send the seized item to an authority of the foreign country that\nrequested the assistance referred to in section 34ZG in relation to\nthe foreign serious offence.\n\nAmendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2\nSearch warrants  Part 1\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Without limiting the directions that may be given under\nsubsection (2), the Attorney-General may direct the seizing officer\nto send the seized item to an authority of the foreign country that\nrequested the assistance referred to in section 34ZG in relation to\nthe foreign serious offence.\n\nAmendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2\nSearch warrants  Part 1\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-34zf"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-34zf-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-34zf-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a308c80d5d2c6a1b911a12f4ac2c6b05d394ce46aeb4a12042bc2667fb2df9a4",
      "skos:note": "Seized item must be sent to foreign country for serious offence investigation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-2-sec-34zf-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "34ZF(3) Dealing with evidential material and certain property or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 94,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting the directions that may be given under\nsubsection (2), the Attorney-General may direct the seizing officer\nto send the seized item to an authority of the foreign country that\nrequested the assistance referred to in section 34ZG in relation to\nthe foreign serious offence.\n\nAmendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2\nSearch warrants  Part 1\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-34zf-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
