        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) Without limiting the directions that may be given under subsection (2),"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-23",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "23 Application provisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-2-sec-23"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.95",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987 (the MACM Act) made by this Part apply in relation to an\napplication made under Part 3-5 of the Proceeds of Crime Act on or\nafter the commencement of this item:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the application relates\nwas acquired before, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(b) whether the conduct to which the application relates occurred\nbefore, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(c) whether the authorisation relating to the application was\ngiven under section 34ZG of the MACM Act before, on or\nafter that commencement.\n(2)\nThe amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987 (the MACM Act) made by this Part apply in relation to a POCA\nsearch warrant issued on or after the commencement of this item:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the warrant relates was\nacquired before, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(b) whether the conduct to which the warrant relates occurred\nbefore, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(c) whether the application for the warrant was made before, on\nor after that commencement; and\n\n(d) whether the authorisation relating to the application for the\nwarrant was given under section 34ZG of the MACM Act\nbefore, on or after that commencement.\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987 (the MACM Act) made by this Part apply in relation to an\napplication made under Part 3-5 of the Proceeds of Crime Act on or\nafter the commencement of this item:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the application relates\nwas acquired before, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(b) whether the conduct to which the application relates occurred\nbefore, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(c) whether the authorisation relating to the application was\ngiven under section 34ZG of the MACM Act before, on or\nafter that commencement.\n(2)\nThe amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987 (the MACM Act) made by this Part apply in relation to a POCA\nsearch warrant issued on or after the commencement of this item:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the warrant relates was\nacquired before, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(b) whether the conduct to which the warrant relates occurred\nbefore, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(c) whether the application for the warrant was made before, on\nor after that commencement; and\n\n(d) whether the authorisation relating to the application for the\nwarrant was given under section 34ZG of the MACM Act\nbefore, on or after that commencement.\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-23-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-23-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c7f450a9fff10a264c76ffd78a49c7f6ec552128cc00d4439a2dcbd6a5b0f097",
      "skos:note": "Amendments of MACM Act apply to POCA search warrants issued on or after commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-2-sec-23",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23 Application provisions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 95,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987 (the MACM Act) made by this Part apply in relation to an\napplication made under Part 3-5 of the Proceeds of Crime Act on or\nafter the commencement of this item:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the application relates\nwas acquired before, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(b) whether the conduct to which the application relates occurred\nbefore, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(c) whether the authorisation relating to the application was\ngiven under section 34ZG of the MACM Act before, on or\nafter that commencement.\n(2)\nThe amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987 (the MACM Act) made by this Part apply in relation to a POCA\nsearch warrant issued on or after the commencement of this item:\n\n(a) whether property or a thing to which the warrant relates was\nacquired before, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(b) whether the conduct to which the warrant relates occurred\nbefore, on or after that commencement; and\n\n(c) whether the application for the warrant was made before, on\nor after that commencement; and\n\n(d) whether the authorisation relating to the application for the\nwarrant was given under section 34ZG of the MACM Act\nbefore, on or after that commencement.\n\nSchedule 2  Amendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters"
    },
