    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-40",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40 Application provisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-2-sec-40"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.98",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987 made by items 30 to 34 of this Part apply in relation to a foreign\nforfeiture order, foreign pecuniary penalty order or foreign restraining\norder made before, on or after the commencement of this item.\n\nAmendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2\nOther amendments  Part 3\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\n\n(2)\nSubsection 34W(2) of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987, as inserted by this Part, applies in relation to a notice given on or\nafter the commencement of this item.\n\nSchedule 3  Amendment of the Extradition Act 1988\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\nNo. 34, 2018",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987 made by items 30 to 34 of this Part apply in relation to a foreign\nforfeiture order, foreign pecuniary penalty order or foreign restraining\norder made before, on or after the commencement of this item.\n\nAmendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2\nOther amendments  Part 3\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\n\n(2)\nSubsection 34W(2) of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987, as inserted by this Part, applies in relation to a notice given on or\nafter the commencement of this item.\n\nSchedule 3  Amendment of the Extradition Act 1988\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\nNo. 34, 2018",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-2-sec-40-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7d0f7baabdbdf592e910b37b831ae43723622d4971cb42a1d33c93075e2b5735",
      "skos:note": "Amendments apply to foreign forfeiture orders, etc."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-2-sec-40",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40 Application provisions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 98,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987 made by items 30 to 34 of this Part apply in relation to a foreign\nforfeiture order, foreign pecuniary penalty order or foreign restraining\norder made before, on or after the commencement of this item.\n\nAmendments relating to mutual assistance in criminal matters  Schedule 2\nOther amendments  Part 3\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\n\n(2)\nSubsection 34W(2) of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act\n1987, as inserted by this Part, applies in relation to a notice given on or\nafter the commencement of this item.\n\nSchedule 3  Amendment of the Extradition Act 1988\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\nNo. 34, 2018"
    },
