      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Recognisance on which bail was granted exists.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Discharge of recognisance is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-3-sec-1-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Require",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Magistrate must require commitment to prison.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Person is brought before magistrate.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Commitment to prison is required."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-3-sec-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2 At the end of section 35",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-3-sec-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.100",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(7) If:\n\n(a) the Federal Court makes an order under subsection (2) that\nthe person be surrendered to New Zealand or confirming an\norder under paragraph 34(1)(c); or\n\n(b) on appeal, the Full Court or the High Court makes an order\nthat the person be surrendered to New Zealand or confirming\nsuch an order;\nthe Federal Court, the Full Court or the High Court (as the case\nmay be) must order that the person be committed to prison pending\nthe execution of the surrender warrant.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(7) If:\n\n(a) the Federal Court makes an order under subsection (2) that\nthe person be surrendered to New Zealand or confirming an\norder under paragraph 34(1)(c); or\n\n(b) on appeal, the Full Court or the High Court makes an order\nthat the person be surrendered to New Zealand or confirming\nsuch an order;\nthe Federal Court, the Full Court or the High Court (as the case\nmay be) must order that the person be committed to prison pending\nthe execution of the surrender warrant.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-3-sec-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-3-sec-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-3-sec-2-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3ff1bc9ca5fc27b677128f929055eb3eb4a62192c08c8f44f108e22956c43f08",
      "skos:note": "Order person to be committed to prison pending execution of surrender warrant if certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-3-sec-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 At the end of section 35",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 100,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(7) If:\n\n(a) the Federal Court makes an order under subsection (2) that\nthe person be surrendered to New Zealand or confirming an\norder under paragraph 34(1)(c); or\n\n(b) on appeal, the Full Court or the High Court makes an order\nthat the person be surrendered to New Zealand or confirming\nsuch an order;\nthe Federal Court, the Full Court or the High Court (as the case\nmay be) must order that the person be committed to prison pending\nthe execution of the surrender warrant."
    },
    {
