    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-4-sec-35",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35 Evidentiary certificates relating to requests made to foreign",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-4-sec-35"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.103",
      "values:originalText": "business authorities\n\n(1) The Chairperson of ASIC may issue a written certificate signed by\nthe Chairperson of ASIC certifying that specified documents or\nthings were obtained as a result of a request made to a foreign\nbusiness authority by ASIC.\n\n(2) The Deputy Chairperson of ASIC may issue a written certificate\nsigned by the Deputy Chairperson of ASIC certifying that specified\ndocuments or things were obtained as a result of a request made to\na foreign business authority by ASIC.\n\n(3) In any proceeding to which this Part applies, a certificate under\nsubsection (1) or (2) is prima facie evidence of the matters stated in\nthe certificate.",
      "skos:definition": "business authorities\n\n(1) The Chairperson of ASIC may issue a written certificate signed by\nthe Chairperson of ASIC certifying that specified documents or\nthings were obtained as a result of a request made to a foreign\nbusiness authority by ASIC.\n\n(2) The Deputy Chairperson of ASIC may issue a written certificate\nsigned by the Deputy Chairperson of ASIC certifying that specified\ndocuments or things were obtained as a result of a request made to\na foreign business authority by ASIC.\n\n(3) In any proceeding to which this Part applies, a certificate under\nsubsection (1) or (2) is prima facie evidence of the matters stated in\nthe certificate.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-4-sec-35-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-4-sec-35-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-4-sec-35-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "89cfabfe8ea6cfcf19321492f5a931d7a9005e6134869ea7b8418bce1241b95b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-4-sec-35",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35 Evidentiary certificates relating to requests made to foreign",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 103,
      "values:originalText": "business authorities\n\n(1) The Chairperson of ASIC may issue a written certificate signed by\nthe Chairperson of ASIC certifying that specified documents or\nthings were obtained as a result of a request made to a foreign\nbusiness authority by ASIC.\n\n(2) The Deputy Chairperson of ASIC may issue a written certificate\nsigned by the Deputy Chairperson of ASIC certifying that specified\ndocuments or things were obtained as a result of a request made to\na foreign business authority by ASIC.\n\n(3) In any proceeding to which this Part applies, a certificate under\nsubsection (1) or (2) is prima facie evidence of the matters stated in\nthe certificate."
    },
    {
