      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.104",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(2)\nThe amendments made by Part 1 of this Schedule also apply in relation\nto proceedings instituted after the commencement of Schedule 5 to the\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018 (whether the proceedings are for offences\n\nProtecting vulnerable persons  Schedule 5\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\n\ncommitted, or alleged to have been committed, before or after the\ncommencement of this Schedule).\n\nSchedule 6  Slavery-like offences and relevant evidence",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n(2)\nThe amendments made by Part 1 of this Schedule also apply in relation\nto proceedings instituted after the commencement of Schedule 5 to the\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018 (whether the proceedings are for offences\n\nProtecting vulnerable persons  Schedule 5\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\n\ncommitted, or alleged to have been committed, before or after the\ncommencement of this Schedule).\n\nSchedule 6  Slavery-like offences and relevant evidence",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-5-sec-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "10e3a8694aa7511520ce225f11f6859f1206c973af5d3df4c0d03395fd55f8ec",
      "skos:note": "Amendments apply to proceedings instituted after Schedule 5 commencement"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-5-sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 At the end of item 93 of Schedule 2",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 104,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(2)\nThe amendments made by Part 1 of this Schedule also apply in relation\nto proceedings instituted after the commencement of Schedule 5 to the\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018 (whether the proceedings are for offences\n\nProtecting vulnerable persons  Schedule 5\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\n\ncommitted, or alleged to have been committed, before or after the\ncommencement of this Schedule).\n\nSchedule 6  Slavery-like offences and relevant evidence"
    },
