      "values:originalText": "The amendment made by this Part applies in relation to notices of\nresignation given after the commencement of this item.\n\nAmendment of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006\nSchedule 9\nReports about physical currency  Part 1\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "skos:definition": "The amendment made by this Part applies in relation to notices of\nresignation given after the commencement of this item.\n\nAmendment of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006\nSchedule 9\nReports about physical currency  Part 1\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
