    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-9-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Application of amendment",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-9-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendment of section 5 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Part applies in\nrelation to disclosures of, and access to, information after this item\ncommences, whether the information was obtained before, on or after\nthat commencement.\n(2)\nFor the purposes of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism\nFinancing Act 2006, if information is disclosed in accordance with a\nprovision of that Act to an official of the Australian Charities and\nNot-for-profits Commission before this item commences, the\ninformation is taken to have been disclosed to an official of a designated\nagency.\n\nAmendment of the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002  Schedule 10\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendment of section 5 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Part applies in\nrelation to disclosures of, and access to, information after this item\ncommences, whether the information was obtained before, on or after\nthat commencement.\n(2)\nFor the purposes of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism\nFinancing Act 2006, if information is disclosed in accordance with a\nprovision of that Act to an official of the Australian Charities and\nNot-for-profits Commission before this item commences, the\ninformation is taken to have been disclosed to an official of a designated\nagency.\n\nAmendment of the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002  Schedule 10\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-9-sec-7-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "38a049e9a2a05d3a8d78b56e44247df8fb5573a8a01272ce9e94b4808cd0725f",
      "skos:note": "Amendment of section 5 of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-9-sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 Application of amendment",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 122,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendment of section 5 of the Anti-Money Laundering and\nCounter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 made by this Part applies in\nrelation to disclosures of, and access to, information after this item\ncommences, whether the information was obtained before, on or after\nthat commencement.\n(2)\nFor the purposes of the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism\nFinancing Act 2006, if information is disclosed in accordance with a\nprovision of that Act to an official of the Australian Charities and\nNot-for-profits Commission before this item commences, the\ninformation is taken to have been disclosed to an official of a designated\nagency.\n\nAmendment of the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002  Schedule 10\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-9-sec-7-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-9-sec-7"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-10-sec-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1 After subsection 4(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-10-sec-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.123",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) For all purposes, if an expression defined in subsection (1) contains\n“ACC”, the expression when used as so defined may also be\nreferred to by replacing “ACC” with any name or acronym\nspecified under subsection 7(1A).\nExample: Expressions to which this subsection applies, including the following,\nmay be used in a document by replacing “ACC” with any name or\nacronym by which the ACC may also be known:\n(a) ACC information;\n(b) ACC operation/investigation;\n(c) member of the staff of the ACC.\n\n(1B) Subsection (1A) does not limit subsection 7(1A).",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1A) For all purposes, if an expression defined in subsection (1) contains\n“ACC”, the expression when used as so defined may also be\nreferred to by replacing “ACC” with any name or acronym\nspecified under subsection 7(1A).\nExample: Expressions to which this subsection applies, including the following,\nmay be used in a document by replacing “ACC” with any name or\nacronym by which the ACC may also be known:\n(a) ACC information;\n(b) ACC operation/investigation;\n(c) member of the staff of the ACC.\n\n(1B) Subsection (1A) does not limit subsection 7(1A).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-10-sec-1-ss-1a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-10-sec-1-ss-1b"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-10-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 After subsection 4(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 123,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) For all purposes, if an expression defined in subsection (1) contains\n“ACC”, the expression when used as so defined may also be\nreferred to by replacing “ACC” with any name or acronym\nspecified under subsection 7(1A).\nExample: Expressions to which this subsection applies, including the following,\nmay be used in a document by replacing “ACC” with any name or\nacronym by which the ACC may also be known:\n(a) ACC information;\n(b) ACC operation/investigation;\n(c) member of the staff of the ACC.\n\n(1B) Subsection (1A) does not limit subsection 7(1A)."
    },
