      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018.pdf, p.123",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\nSchedule 10  Amendment of the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\nNo. 34, 2018\n\n(5) The Chief Executive Officer of the ACC may also refer to himself\nor herself, and be referred to, by replacing “ACC” with any name\nor acronym specified under subsection 7(1A).\n\nAmendment of the AusCheck Act 2007  Schedule 11\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\nSchedule 10  Amendment of the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\nNo. 34, 2018\n\n(5) The Chief Executive Officer of the ACC may also refer to himself\nor herself, and be referred to, by replacing “ACC” with any name\nor acronym specified under subsection 7(1A).\n\nAmendment of the AusCheck Act 2007  Schedule 11\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018-sch-10-sec-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3b11a5a8bf02b626a9a2ed815d9dbf7ded589f0baa72f53b6393682e5d770fa4",
      "skos:note": "Replaces 'ACC' with a specified name or acronym"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-international-crime-cooperation-and-other-measures-act-2018#sch-10-sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 At the end of section 37",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 123,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\nSchedule 10  Amendment of the Australian Crime Commission Act 2002\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018\nNo. 34, 2018\n\n(5) The Chief Executive Officer of the ACC may also refer to himself\nor herself, and be referred to, by replacing “ACC” with any name\nor acronym specified under subsection 7(1A).\n\nAmendment of the AusCheck Act 2007  Schedule 11\n\nNo. 34, 2018\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (International Crime Cooperation and\nOther Measures) Act 2018"
    },
